  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6066,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce278:017C7",
  "jp": "アイ「なにってチョコバーよ。{nl}　これがビターで、これがナッツ入りで、こっちがホワイト」",
  "off": 6087,
  "len": 49,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6089,
  "text_len": 46
 },
 {
  "id": "sce278:017FB",
  "jp": "トウヤ「いや、そういうことじゃなくてだな‥‥」",
  "off": 6139,
  "len": 28,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6141,
  "text_len": 25
 },
 {
  "id": "sce278:0181E",
